From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chad Cormier Roussel <chadcormierroussel@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:39:05 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] loader: Build the preloaders without LTO.

The preloaders (loader's and patch 0005's loader64) are linked static at a
fixed high address; compiled to LTO bitcode (CFLAGS=-flto=thin,
MacNeutron's performance build), their code was generated at link time
for the default small code model and lld refused their R_X86_64_32
relocations. They run once per process, before exec: nothing to gain
from LTO.

Assisted-by: Claude Code: claude-opus-5-5
---
 loader/Makefile.in   | 2 +-
 loader64/Makefile.in | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/loader/Makefile.in b/loader/Makefile.in
index a9ca82f3..af74a571 100644
--- a/loader/Makefile.in
+++ b/loader/Makefile.in
@@ -10,7 +10,7 @@ PROGRAMS = $(WINELOADER_PROGRAMS)
 INSTALL_LIB = $(WINELOADER_PROGRAMS)
 UNIX_CFLAGS = -fPIE
 
-preloader_EXTRADEFS = -fno-builtin
+preloader_EXTRADEFS = -fno-builtin -fno-lto
 
 wine_OBJS = main.o
 wine_DEPS = $(WINELOADER_DEPENDS)
diff --git a/loader64/Makefile.in b/loader64/Makefile.in
index cfbe51d4..decb62ec 100644
--- a/loader64/Makefile.in
+++ b/loader64/Makefile.in
@@ -9,7 +9,7 @@ PROGRAMS = wine64 wine64-preloader
 INSTALL_LIB = wine64 wine64-preloader
 UNIX_CFLAGS = -fPIE
 
-preloader_EXTRADEFS = -fno-builtin
+preloader_EXTRADEFS = -fno-builtin -fno-lto
 
 wine64_OBJS = main.o
 wine64_DEPS = $(WINELOADER_DEPENDS)
